@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title Capability Module Definition
top to bottom direction

package "Source Shape" {
  rectangle "Module File Organization" as Files <<zoom>> [[define_capability_module/organize_module_files.puml]]
  rectangle "Rhai Asset Declaration" as Rhai <<zoom>> [[define_capability_module/declare_rhai_assets.puml]]
}

package "Native Shape" {
  rectangle "Native Backing Attachment" as Native <<zoom>> [[define_capability_module/attach_native_backing.puml]]
  rectangle "Module Shape Check" as Check
}

Files --> Rhai : classifies files for
Rhai --> Native : names required surfaces for
Native --> Check : proves kernel backing to
@enduml
